+ * number of full-bandwidth channels. -1 = coupling off
+ * ac3_coupling_start_tab[channel_mode-2][sample rate code][bit rate code]
+ *
+ * TODO: more testing for optimal parameters.
+ *       multi-channel tests at 44.1kHz and 32kHz.
+ */
