@@ -0,0 +1,436 @@
+/*
+ * AC-3 encoder float/fixed template
+ * Copyright (c) 2000 Fabrice Bellard
+ * Copyright (c) 2006-2011 Justin Ruggles <justin.ruggles@gmail.com>
+ * Copyright (c) 2006-2010 Prakash Punnoor <prakash@punnoor.de>
