@@ -0,0 +1,120 @@
+@
+@ ARMv4-optimized IDCT functions
+@ Copyright (c) 2004 AGAWA Koji <i (AT) atty (DOT) jp>
+@
+@ This file is part of FFmpeg.
+@
+@ FFmpeg is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
